# story/construction/ 是施工真源；.prewrite/ 与 .analysis/ 用于派生材料和待确认事项，默认不忽略。

# macOS local metadata

# Claude local metadata
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
!.claude/scripts/
!.claude/scripts/**

# Codex local metadata
.codex/*
!.codex/config.toml
!.codex/skills
!.codex/skills/
!.codex/skills/**
!.codex/agents
!.codex/agents/
!.codex/agents/**
claude-mem-*.tgz
_mem/mem-*.md

# Python local caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.uv-cache/

# Local metadata for analysis, export, and validation outputs
.analysis/*
!.analysis/README.md
!.analysis/blueprints/
!.analysis/blueprints/**
!.analysis/archived/
.analysis/archived/*
!.analysis/archived/科技与精神之海机制分析.md
